    "AdeeboMeter for gaming - whose lag is it?": "AdeeboMeter pour les jeux : d’où vient le délai?",
    "Whose lag is it?": "D’où vient le délai?",
    "Valorant, Fortnite, League of Legends, Counter-Strike 2, Roblox and more - AdeeboMeter knows their servers. It watches the ones you play on, notices when a game opens, and tells you whether the lag was you, your Wi-Fi, your provider or the game.": "Valorant, Fortnite, League of Legends, Counter-Strike 2, Roblox et autres : AdeeboMeter connaît leurs serveurs, détecte les jeux ouverts et distingue PC, Wi-Fi, fournisseur et serveur.",
    "The Gamer Zone: popular games to add, and the servers of the one being watched": "Zone Gamer : jeux à ajouter et serveurs du jeu surveillé",
    "Your best server": "Votre meilleur serveur",
    "Each region's ping, jitter and loss, and the one that suits you - measured over a week, evenings included.": "Ping, gigue et pertes par région, mesurés sur une semaine, soirées comprises.",
    "Every second while you play": "Chaque seconde pendant le jeu",
    "When a game opens, its servers are checked every second, and spikes are kept with whose fault they were.": "Les serveurs sont vérifiés chaque seconde quand un jeu s’ouvre; les pointes sont conservées avec leur cause.",
    "Match reports": "Rapports de parties",
    "After a session: the spikes, the worst moments and what caused them - in plain words.": "Après la session : pointes, pires moments et causes en mots simples.",
    "Test under load": "Tester sous charge",
    "Does a download in the house wreck your ping? One test shows it.": "Un téléchargement fait-il monter votre ping? Un test le montre.",
    "Report for your ISP": "Rapport au fournisseur",
    "The route to your game's server, hop by hop, and where the loss starts - with every rough minute of the week from your records.": "Chemin vers le serveur de jeu, début des pertes et minutes difficiles de la semaine.",
    "Any game": "Tous les jeux",
    "Add your own game with any server address.": "Ajoutez un jeu avec son adresse de serveur.",
    "Nothing is sent to game servers until you add a game. Then: pings (or timed connections) to its regions, at the pace you choose in Settings.": "Rien n’est envoyé aux serveurs avant l’ajout d’un jeu. Ensuite, pings ou connexions chronométrées selon le rythme choisi.",
