    "On this phone - nothing is uploaded.": "Sur ce téléphone, sans téléversement.",
    "A web app isn't allowed to read your signal, but your phone shows it on its field test screen. Record that screen while you move, and this reads every number off the recording.": "Une application Web ne peut pas lire le signal directement. Enregistrez l’écran Field Test pendant le trajet; cet outil lit ses mesures.",
    "Up to 30 seconds of video (one moment a second) or 30 screenshots. Read on this phone, then forgotten - your phone number and IMEI on that screen are skipped.": "Jusqu’à 30 secondes de vidéo, un relevé par seconde, ou 30 captures. Lecture locale, sans conservation. Numéro de téléphone et IMEI sont ignorés.",
