    "Reads settings, no admin. Never tries a password, never looks you up in a breach database, never scans beyond your router.": "Lee ajustes sin administrador. Nunca prueba contraseñas, consulta filtraciones ni escanea más allá del router.",
    "Path & routing": "Recorrido y rutas",
    "MTU per hop, MTR, the way back, which route, your gateway (VRRP / HSRP), routing protocols on your segment, IPv6.": "MTU por salto, MTR, vuelta, ruta elegida, puerta de enlace (VRRP / HSRP), protocolos del segmento e IPv6.",
